    <section class="hero">
        <div class="container-fluid">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-lg-10 offset-lg-1">
                    <h1 class="hero-title">Page not found</h1>
                    <div class="hero-description">
                        <p><p>Oops! Sorry about that. We&rsquo;re in the process of implementing a more effective UTA web experience, and we appreciate your patience as we update our website.</p>
<p>What you&rsquo;re looking for doesn&rsquo;t seem to be here. This may be due to:</p>
<ul style="padding-left: 1.25em;">
    <li>a broken link</li>
    <li>an&nbsp;out-of date bookmark</li>
    <li>a&nbsp;search engine&nbsp;which needs to be updated</li>
    <li>a&nbsp;mistyped website address</li>
</ul>
<h2 style="margin-top:2em;">TRY A SEARCH</h2>
<form action="/search" method="get" class="uta-search-form" id="uta-search-form">
    <fieldset>
    <div class="form-row">
    <div class="form-group col-md-6">
    <input aria-label="Search UTA" name="q" placeholder="Search UTA" type="text" class="form-control" style="height:41px;" />
    </div>
    <div class="form-group col-md-6">
    <button class="uta-btn uta-btn-compact-primary" type="submit"><span>Go <span class="fas fa-angle-right"></span></span></button>
    </div>
    </div>
    </fieldset>
</form>
<h2 style="margin-top:2em;">HELPFUL RESOURCES</h2>
<p>Visit our online&nbsp;<a href="https://www.uta.edu/help/">Help Center</a>&nbsp;to find links to popular resources and answers to frequently asked questions.</p>
<h2 style="margin-top:2em;">REPORT A PROBLEM</h2>
<p>Submit a Website Support ticket in <a href="https://uta.service-now.com/selfservice2?id=utassp01_sc_home">Service Now</a>. </p>
<p>Or, call our Service Desk (817-272-2208) for urgent matters.</p></p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</main>

        



